	"hardwareControls": [
		"61-key keyboard",
		"PERFORMANCE: Master level, Pitch stick, Mod wheel",
		"LAYERS / PROGRAM: Layer A, Layer B, Layer C, Layer D, Program display, Program dial",
		"SYNTH ENGINE: Oscillator control, LFO rate, Filter cutoff, Filter resonance, Filter attack, Filter release, Amp attack, Amp release",
		"EFFECTS: FX amount, Delay mix, Delay feedback, Reverb mix"
	],
	"notice": "Configure Global MIDI for the full instrument or Layer MIDI for individual layers; aftertouch and Morph routing depend on setup. Four LED faders control the four layers. Only sustain is mapped here. Match the instrument MIDI channel and receive filters before sending notes or CCs. USB carries MIDI/data rather than audio; connect the audio outputs separately. Consult the download page for the correct Windows USB driver. Port aliases have not been verified on hardware; select the profile manually. The drawings are selected-control schematics rather than scale panel plans. Keyboard and panel controls remain unbound; splits, octave shifts and layer routing can change their behavior. Only the listed CCs are supplied, not the full MIDI implementation.",
